  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The manners verbs",
   "texto": [
    "**Potere** (power), **volere** (want) and **dovere** (duty, have that) are irregular. They have a **infinitivo**: **Posso entrare?** (can I come in?), **Voglio mangiare** (I want to eat), **Devo lavorare** (I have to work).",
    "Denial goes before the first: **Non posso venire** (I cannot come)."
   ]
  },
