   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Know or power",
   "texto": [
    "**sapere**: **So nuotare** (I know how to swim), **Sai guidare?** (do you know how to drive?) is used for a learned skill.",
    "For a possibility or a permit, **potere**: **Posso aprire la finestra?** is used (can I open the window?).",
    "To ask for a favor: **Puoi aiutarmi?** (can you help me?)."
   ]
